WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You had to cut your seaso
of "Good Girls" short

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:03.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
by a few episodes
because you were still

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:06.573 size:88% position:44%
in the middle of filming
when this all came down.

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
Your character Ruby
was shot this year

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:11.044 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you had to drive aroun
in a motorized scooter.

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:12.812 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Is that easier or harder

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:15.615
than learning how to ride a bike
after 30 years?

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:16.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Easier...
-Okay.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.252 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...but you have
to figure out the speed,

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:22.355
because, you know, when you have
to hit a mark at a certain time,

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:25.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
if you're not walking,
you don't really have control.

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:28.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
So it took a couple of takes
to figure out --

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:30.930
Especially there's a scene
where I'm just circling,

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:31.931 line:92%
but I'm passing doorways,

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:35.568
and I need to get my line in
at the doorway before I pass

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:38.571
So it took a while to figure out
before I was like --

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:40.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
"And he said what?!",
you know?

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Both laugh ]
-That's great.

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:46.746
-But I just noticed that
I'm sitting directly in front of

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:50.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
my Jonathan Adler vase,
which is a butt.

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:54.120 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Both laugh ]

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, you are.
Sorry.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:59.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
Too late to fix it.
[ Laughs ]

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:01.594 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Are you watching any TV?

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:05.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
We know you to be a great love
of the small screen.

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:08.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes. "Killing Eve" is back,
so I'm watching that.

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:09.702 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
Always great.

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:14.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm re-watching "West Wing"
and "The Good Wife."

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:17.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
"The Good Wife" holds up.
-Oh, good to know.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:20.814 size:84% position:42%
-"The Good Wife" has --
"West Wing," it's good,

00:01:20.814 --> 00:01:23.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
but there's a lot of
misogyny in it.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.685 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, interesting.
-Yeah.

00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:28.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's surprisingly
a lot of misogyny.

00:01:28.955 --> 00:01:33.593 size:81% position:41%
Every time I watch it,
I'm like, "Ooh, okay."

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:35.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
Not what I would expect.

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:37.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
A good heads-up.
-I know, it's weird.

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:39.833 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like, you know,
a lot of, like, sly comments

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:43.937
which, you know, would've just
rolled off people's back before.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:45.738 line:92%
But watching it in this era,

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:48.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like,
"Mnh-mnh, Aaron, mnh-mnh.

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:51.211 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:53.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
Retta, thank you so much
for being here.

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:55.782 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's always such a delight
to see you.

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:58.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Good Girls" airs Sunday,
on NBC.

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:00.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
We'll be right back
with more "Late Night."

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:01.488 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Thanks.

